      "cover": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Person_writing_in_notebook_while_using_laptop_at_a_modern_workspace.jpg/1920px-Person_writing_in_notebook_while_using_laptop_at_a_modern_workspace.jpg",
