    {
      "id": "soundscape",
      "title": "Soundscape — 互動環境音",
      "category": "Experiment",
      "year": "2026",
      "summary": "用四條序列驅動的生成式環境音，替作品頁做可互動的聲音層。",
      "cover": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Eurorack_Modular_Synthesizer_Closeup.jpg/1920px-Eurorack_Modular_Synthesizer_Closeup.jpg",
      "tags": ["Web Audio", "Canvas"],
      "links": [],
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "text", "text": "聲音在網頁上最常被誤用：自動播放、關不掉、音量失控。這個實驗的前提是——永遠由使用者按下播放，永遠有明顯的停止鍵。" },
        { "type": "image", "src": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Eurorack_Modular_Synthesizer_Closeup.jpg/1920px-Eurorack_Modular_Synthesizer_Closeup.jpg", "alt": "模組合成器與耳機的靜物照", "caption": "四條序列，八個振盪器。" },
        { "type": "text", "text": "技術上用 Web Audio 的排程佇列，避免 setTimeout 的抖動。聽起來像環境音，其實是精確到毫秒的排程。" }
      ]
